Type: Package
Package: parallel.lsm
Title: Parallel Processing Wrappers for _landscapemetrics_ Functions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Tanner", "Hammond", , "idonutunderstand@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides wrapper functions for _landscapemetrics_ that process data in parallel. parallel.lsm wrappers stay close to the original package and give users already familiar with landscapemetrics a quick method to speed up processing.
